        "text": "=List all the products and ingredients needed to make {{ $json.receipe }}\n\nReturn a clear bulleted list with approximate quantities. Keep it short and practical.\n\nIf the recipe name is unclear, ask the user to rephrase it.\n\nGive the result only in JSON format. template sshould be \n{\"receipe\" : \"\",\n\"products\" : \"\"}",
